<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px7" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">OpenBookQA</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px8" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">PIQA</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px9" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">SciQ</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px10" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">TruthfulQA</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px11" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Winogender</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS2.Px12" title="In A.3.2 Evaluated benchmarks ‣ A.3 Evaluated models and benchmarks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">WinoGrande</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>DCS evaluation prompting templates</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Measuring Language Model Hallucinations Through Distributional Correctness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Results as calculated by other metrics</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
