</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.p6.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS4.p6.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{Ice fishing}: {A man is kneeling on a frozen lake. A video is shown of the cold waters below. A fish}{" swims up to the bait and grabs it as the man reels it in.", " is shown on the ice.", " gets caught in the frozen waters.", " is belly tied to a hook.", " I do not know."}
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
