<span id="A1.SS4.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS4.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The following are multiple choice questions (with answers) about {global facts}. Answer only if you are confident, since mistakes may be penalised, while correct answers receive points. It is acceptable to answer with ’?’ if you are unsure, and you will receive 0 points.
</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.p7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS4.p7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{The percentage of children in Ethiopia (age 8) who reported physical punishment by teachers in the past week in 2009 was about what?
</span></span>
